# Exit Specialist's trigger says "another target creature", not "target creature an opponent controls": turned face up (CR 702.168d) with only Bot1's own Ornithopter
# besides itself on the battlefield, the Ornithopter is the one legal target and returns to Bot1's hand. The Specialist stays on the battlefield.
# The disguise cost {1}{U} needs a blue source (CR 702.168d, 107.4): with only black, white and red sources untapped it is refused; the Mox Sapphire cast then makes it payable.

